2026-06-26 03:09:42,527 | AGENT | SecurityCompliance Agent answered: To address the requirements mentioned, Faber IA can implement several security controls and compliance measures. For GDPR compliance, as an ISO 27001 certified company since 2023 with a scope that includes development, delivery, and operations, we have a solid foundation for data protection. Our ISO 27701 certification further extends our privacy information management capabilities.

To protect personal and health data, we utilize encryption in transit via TLS 1.3 and encryption at rest using AES-256. We also employ pseudonymisation and data minimisation principles to reduce the risk associated with sensitive data. Configurable retention policies ensure that data is not kept longer than necessary. Strict tenant isolation ensures logical separation between client corpora, and role-based access control (RBAC) limits access to authorized personnel only.

For hosting data exclusively within the European Union, our partnership with OuraneCloud, a SecNumCloud-qualified sovereign cloud provider, ensures that all data hosting is compliant with EU data sovereignty requirements. This infrastructure is also covered by our HDS certification for health-data hosting, which aligns with the need to protect sensitive health information.

To prevent any rupture in clinical or administrative workflows, we focus on integrating our solution seamlessly into existing practices without disrupting them. Our experience with delivering solutions that fit into existing workflows will be beneficial here.

Lastly, for explainable recommendations or suggestions, our product, Atelier, is grounded in sources and provides a retrieval trace and audit log. It supports a posteriori review and traceability, ensuring transparency in how outputs are generated. This capability aligns with the need for explainability and accountability in AI-driven decision support systems.

By leveraging these capabilities, Faber IA can effectively address the mentioned requirements and ensure a high level of security and compliance for sensitive data processing and protection.
